 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/cmd-case_900.jpg\" alt=\"the large crawfords metal detector case\" title=\"Large carry case for Minelab Manticore, minelab equinox and xTerra Pro metal detectors\" width=\"349\" height=\"196\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "h2",
   "html": "Carry case for Metal detectors"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Also Suitable for the Minelab Equinox 900/700 and the Minelab X-terra Pro and GPX 6000, along with other brand metal detectors which collapse."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "such as Deus 1 and deus 2, nokta legend and nokta simplex."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Made from 600D water resistant Fabric, fitted with a 3 sided zipper to allow wide opening, and Velcro straps inside to secure your detector"
  },
  {
   "t": "h3",
   "html": "Large Carry case for Minelab Manticore and search coils"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/cmd-case_manti_coils.jpg\" alt=\"large case for minelab manticore and minelab equinox\" title=\"carry case for minelab manticore\" width=\"299\" height=\"168\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "This CMD Large case will also carry extra search coils including the COILTEK NOX 18, plus spare lower shafts."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Manticore featured with the optional M15 and M8 search coils, Equinox 900 and COILTEK NOX 14x9 and Minelab 6\"search coil."
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/cmd-case_headphones.jpg\" alt=\"large carry case for minelab manticore metal detectors\" title=\"carry case for minelab manticore\" width=\"297\" height=\"167\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "The Front pocket will fit more accessories including 15x12 search coil, headphones,"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "charging leads, power pack, gloves or other stuff you carry about."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Pocket size 330mm (13 inch) x 400mm (15 3/4 inch)"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/cmd-case_molle.jpg\" alt=\"large case to carry metal detectors\" title=\"cmd case for minelab metal detectors\" width=\"297\" height=\"167\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "The Front of the CMD Large case"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "is Fitted with MOLLE style fittings"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "which allow for fitting a water bottle holder, 1st aid kit and more"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/cmd-case_shoulder-straps.jpg\" alt=\"metal detector large carry case\" title=\"CMD large metal detector case\" width=\"296\" height=\"167\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Along with the top edge carry handles there are also 2 over shoulder fully adjustable straps to use the carry case as a ruck sack,"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "so you can setup your detector where you park and carry all the needed coils, cables and shafts with you"
  },
  {
   "t": "figure",
   "html": "<img src=\"@img:images/cmd-case_size.jpg\" alt=\"how big is the CMD large carry case\" title=\"size of the cmd carry case\" width=\"295\" height=\"166\">"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Approximate sizes of the CMD large detector case are 800mm (31 inch) x 540mm (21 inch)"
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Made from tough padded 800 Denier water resistant material."
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "<a href=\"https://bit.ly/cmdbackpack\" data-kind=\"affiliate\">BUY THE CMD BACKPACK HERE</a>"
  }
 ],
